note a small shop with a record, a function, and a loop
a record called item has name as text and price as number and quantity as number

define total price of items as a list of item giving a number
let sum be 0
for each item in items do
add price of item times quantity of item to sum
end for
give back sum
end define

define describe of number as number giving text
if number is greater than 10 then
give back the words big end words
otherwise
give back the words small end words
end if
end define

let basket be an empty list of item
add a new item with name the words apple end words and price 3 and quantity 2 to basket
add a new item with name the words pear end words and price 4 and quantity 5 to basket
let total be total price of basket
say the words Total is end words followed by total
say the words That is a end words followed by describe of total followed by the words order end words
say entry 1 of basket
